    "texts": [
      {
        "key": "t01_clinical",
        "text": "I am 36, take 100 mg of sertraline daily, and over the past 24 hours took 4 double doses of an over-the-counter dextromethorphan cough syrup for a bad cough. For the past 3 hours I have had constant tremors and heavy diaphoresis. What could be causing this?",
