        "authored_by": "synthetic_example"
      },
      {
        "key": "t03_colloquial",
        "text": "cough syrup always makes people feel kinda jittery so i really dont wanna overreact over a normal side effect.",
        "sha256": "16a8a9b7e1645aff84995ff2f19cf334dd966d24e5bc41de647c0b0f470dee5f",
        "register": "colloquial",
        "authored_by": "synthetic_example"
      },
      {
        "key": "t04_clinical",
        "text": "Over the past hour I have developed involuntary leg clonus with muscle stiffness whenever I move my ankles, and my thermometer just hit 39.6 °C — I am having severe hyperthermia.",
